{
  "script_id": "tetrahedron-volume",
  "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
  "voice_key": "xiaoxiao",
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "tetrahedron-volume",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/tetrahedron-volume/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.44,
      "size": 55008,
      "text": "平面上，二阶行列式的绝对值等于两个向量张成的平行四边形面积。这个结论很多人都知道。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "tetrahedron-volume",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/tetrahedron-volume/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.27,
      "size": 52272,
      "text": "空间里会怎样？三个向量张成一个平行六面体，它的体积恰好是三阶行列式的绝对值。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "tetrahedron-volume",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/tetrahedron-volume/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.09,
      "size": 65520,
      "text": "这个量有个专门的名字，叫标量三重积：第一个向量点乘后两个的叉积。屏幕上红绿蓝三条棱就是行列式的三列。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "tetrahedron-volume",
      "section_id": "sixth",
      "line_id": "sx-1",
      "filename": "sixth-sx-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/tetrahedron-volume/xiaoxiao/sixth-sx-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.66,
      "size": 42624,
      "text": "四面体的体积公式是行列式绝对值再除以六。这个六是从哪来的？"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "tetrahedron-volume",
      "section_id": "sixth",
      "line_id": "sx-2",
      "filename": "sixth-sx-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/tetrahedron-volume/xiaoxiao/sixth-sx-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.43,
      "size": 70848,
      "text": "答案是几何的：一个平行六面体恰好能切成六个等体积的四面体。先对半切成两个三棱柱，每个三棱柱再切成三个四面体。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "tetrahedron-volume",
      "section_id": "sixth",
      "line_id": "sx-3",
      "filename": "sixth-sx-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/tetrahedron-volume/xiaoxiao/sixth-sx-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.48,
      "size": 55728,
      "text": "请点击切成六块那个按钮，六个不同颜色的四面体会依次显示出来，拼起来正好填满整个六面体。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "tetrahedron-volume",
      "section_id": "factorial",
      "line_id": "fc-1",
      "filename": "factorial-fc-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/tetrahedron-volume/xiaoxiao/factorial-fc-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.96,
      "size": 47376,
      "text": "更一般的规律是：n 维空间里，单纯形的体积等于行列式绝对值除以 n 的阶乘。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "tetrahedron-volume",
      "section_id": "factorial",
      "line_id": "fc-2",
      "filename": "factorial-fc-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/tetrahedron-volume/xiaoxiao/factorial-fc-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.28,
      "size": 68400,
      "text": "二维时阶乘是二，三角形面积等于行列式的一半，这与我们熟悉的结论一致。三维时阶乘是六，正是四面体的情形。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "tetrahedron-volume",
      "section_id": "factorial",
      "line_id": "fc-3",
      "filename": "factorial-fc-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/tetrahedron-volume/xiaoxiao/factorial-fc-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.16,
      "size": 50544,
      "text": "所以那个六并不特殊，它只是三的阶乘。四维单纯形要除二十四，五维除一百二十。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "tetrahedron-volume",
      "section_id": "sign",
      "line_id": "sn-1",
      "filename": "sign-sn-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/tetrahedron-volume/xiaoxiao/sign-sn-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.84,
      "size": 45504,
      "text": "行列式还带正负号，这个符号编码了三条棱的定向，也就是右手系还是左手系。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "tetrahedron-volume",
      "section_id": "sign",
      "line_id": "sn-2",
      "filename": "sign-sn-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/tetrahedron-volume/xiaoxiao/sign-sn-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.59,
      "size": 57456,
      "text": "请切到反定向那个预设，它把前两条棱交换了。屏幕上带符号体积变成负数，而绝对值完全没变。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "tetrahedron-volume",
      "section_id": "sign",
      "line_id": "sn-3",
      "filename": "sign-sn-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/tetrahedron-volume/xiaoxiao/sign-sn-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.74,
      "size": 59904,
      "text": "这正是行列式的反对称性：交换任意两列，符号翻转。屏幕上的交换变号误差读数验证了它精确成立。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "tetrahedron-volume",
      "section_id": "coplanar",
      "line_id": "cp-1",
      "filename": "coplanar-cp-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/tetrahedron-volume/xiaoxiao/coplanar-cp-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.38,
      "size": 54000,
      "text": "最后看退化情形。如果三条棱共面，平行六面体就被压扁成一张平板，体积变成零。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "tetrahedron-volume",
      "section_id": "coplanar",
      "line_id": "cp-2",
      "filename": "coplanar-cp-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/tetrahedron-volume/xiaoxiao/coplanar-cp-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.5,
      "size": 56016,
      "text": "反过来也成立：行列式为零就说明三个向量线性相关，必定共面。这是判定共面最快的方法。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "tetrahedron-volume",
      "section_id": "coplanar",
      "line_id": "cp-3",
      "filename": "coplanar-cp-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/tetrahedron-volume/xiaoxiao/coplanar-cp-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.67,
      "size": 58752,
      "text": "屏幕上还用两种独立算法交叉验证体积：三重积法与底面积乘高再除三。两者残差精确为零。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "tetrahedron-volume",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/tetrahedron-volume/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.82,
      "size": 45072,
      "text": "第一，平行六面体体积等于三阶行列式的绝对值，四面体是它的六分之一。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "tetrahedron-volume",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/tetrahedron-volume/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.28,
      "size": 36432,
      "text": "第二，那个六就是三的阶乘，n 维单纯形要除以 n 的阶乘。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "tetrahedron-volume",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/tetrahedron-volume/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.54,
      "size": 56592,
      "text": "第三，行列式的符号表示定向，为零则三棱共面、四面体退化。感谢观看，我们下次再见。"
    }
  ],
